  "ingredients": [
    "2 (7 ounce) beef tenderloin steaks",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste",
    "0.25 cup butter",
    "1 (6 ounce) can crab, drained",
    "1 pound asparagus, tough ends snapped",
    "1 packet dry Bearnaise sauce mix (such as Knorr®)",
    "1 cup whole milk",
    "0.5 cup butter"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GnPlBq_RyZyMhDBBlRqx1G_EnXg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-216800-jessicas-steak-oscar-VAT-6465-Step-01-17a780208c87441ea62cdc51281f0f19.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216800/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven's broiler and set the oven rack about 6 inches from the heat source. Sprinkle the filets with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mw4AiTiMqAdkvAsWps6QepTr3is=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-216800-jessicas-steak-oscar-VAT-6471-Step-02-13be24c5074a4d4cbc70c5e2fa6406d9-74de7e14c0fc4f1780c66d93bc1d748a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216800/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt 1/4 cup of butter in a small saucepan over low heat; gently stir in crab meat and simmer while you broil the beef filets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mb4oKu-uWJ1zELp_BYQoc8moPng=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-216800-jessicas-steak-oscar-VAT-6466-Step-03-6f985f90a0404bc886c26b96fac534dd-8da7d36841364cefbd6e29731a8e8f71.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216800/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Broil steaks until they reach the desired stage of doneness; for medium (slightly pink in the center), broil 10 to 12 minutes on the first side and 6 minutes on the second side. Set steaks aside to rest.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/M5YI2TNRYNXnAlcpt9xdD4h2jbw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-216800-jessicas-steak-oscar-VAT-6479-Step-04-f250fcc2ec914e1a963f29ade9ea82ba-66f79f1a62cc4a9d9df9d02dc3608c30.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216800/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place a steamer insert into a skillet, and fill with water to just below the bottom of the steamer. Cover, and bring the water to a boil over high heat. Add asparagus, recover, and steam until just tender, 2 to 6 minutes depending on thickness.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hgcNVZxJdRUNIlXLPzvBSMsG4sc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-216800-jessicas-steak-oscar-VAT-6477-Step-05-fd3d64fa9d8343f8bdb154854c6cba43.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216800/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk Bearnaise sauce mix with milk in a saucepan. Add 1/2 cup of butter, and bring the sauce to a boil over medium heat, whisking constantly; reduce heat to a simmer, and whisk until sauce has thickened, about 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7yZq0POGeHcnJI5RhmoEsPv3QYo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-216800-jessicas-steak-oscar-VAT-6473-Step-06-0f423624015247f19bdb13c690b38330-23de46c079654a02b6c3fe84f41d6709.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216800/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To assemble, top each broiled steak filet with crab meat, then half of the asparagus. Spoon Bearnaise sauce to taste over asparagus and serve.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_E33L0W4SlTzZSWsT36iP5vf5U0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-216800-jessicas-steak-oscar-VAT-6950-Step-07-74db056f783e45d1adc1095023368b28.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/216800/step_07.webp"
    }
